    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the thing is i already tried contacting support and the email bounced back like the address doesn't exist anymore. it's not just a lost password or a glitchy site... it's like the records of me being there are being deleted. even my old cloud storage folders look weird, like the timestamps are being shifted. if it's just a technical error, why would it hit three different, unrelated platforms at the exact same time? doesn't that seem way too coordinated to be a coincidence?",
